    "Upstream files were re-fetched locally for this snapshot; tests must use only checked-in catalog/provenance/profile data.",
    "Existing representative G36 examples are source-reviewed fixture-only pre-flattened CXF fragments. They are not canonical ASHRAE G36 composite import support.",
    "The vav_single_zone fixture-only fragment now has complete in-repo Tier-A oracle coverage for heating_enabled, cooling_signal/internal coolingPid.y, airflow_setpoint, and damper_command; the broader PID derivative-term and canonical SingleZone.VAV.Controller equivalence work remains separate.",
    "Standalone TrimAndRespond have_hol=false is recorded as restricted explicit-CXF composite import evidence only; it remains import-structure-only without an independent whole-sequence oracle.",
    "SupplyTemperature is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence using the default parameterization and nested TrimAndRespond have_hol=false; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing or a named operation-mode enum claim.",
    "SupplyFan is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the default have_perZonRehBox=false, controllerType=PI variant with explicit maxSet=410 Pa and nested TrimAndRespond have_hol=false; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing or perimeter/non-PI variant support.",
    "SupplySignals is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the default have_heaCoi=true, have_cooCoi=true, controllerType=PI variant; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, coil-absent variant support, or non-PI/PID derivative-term support.",
    "PlantRequests is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the default heaCoi=WaterBased and cooCoi=WaterBased variant with active chilled-water and hot-water request branches; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing or non-water coil variant support.",
    "ReliefDamper is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar no-fan variant with dpBuiSet=12 Pa, k=0.5, controllerType=P, reverseActing=false, and supply-fan proof switching; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, ReliefFanGroup support, or non-default PID variant support.",
    "ReliefFan is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar single-relief-fan variant with relFanSpe_min=0.1, dpBuiSet=12 Pa, k=1, hys=0.005, MovingAverage(delta=300), controllerType=P, reverseActing=false, relief-damper latch/clear timing, and relief-fan start/stop timing; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, ReliefFanGroup support, FreezeProtection, or non-default PID variant support.",
    "ReturnFanAirflowTracking is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar airflow-tracking variant with difFloSet=1 m3/s, conTyp=PI, k=1, Ti=0.5 s, Td=0.1 s, minSpe=0, maxSpe=1, supply-fan proof switching return-fan speed to zero, and a fixture-local Boolean identity bridge for source alias y1RetFan = u1SupFan; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, ReliefFanGroup support, FreezeProtection support, or non-default controller/parameter variant support.",
    "ReturnFanDirectPressure is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar direct-pressure return-fan variant with dpBuiSet=12 Pa, p_rel_RetFan_min=2.4 Pa, p_rel_RetFan_max=40 Pa, conTyp=PI, k=1, Ti=0.5 s, Td=0.1 s, parent-default disSpe_min=0.1, disSpe_max=1, MovingAverage(delta=300), default PID reverseActing=true, relief-damper gating by u1MinOutAirDam AND u1SupFan, and a fixture-local Boolean identity bridge for source alias y1RetFan = u1SupFan; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, ReliefFanGroup support, FreezeProtection support, or non-default controller/parameter variant support.",
    "Economizers.Subsequences.Enable is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the dry-bulb variant with use_enthalpy=false, delTOutHis=1 K, retDamFulOpeTim=180 s, disDel=15 s, supply-fan proof gating, freeze-protection stage zero gating, and no enthalpy high-limit branch; it is not arbitrary Modelica parsing, full Economizers.Controller support, package-level Economizers.Subsequences support, Limits, Modulations, or other Enable parameterization support.",
    "OutdoorAirFlow ASHRAE62_1.AHU is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar AHU-level calculation with minOADes=SingleDamper and explicit design airflow parameters; package-level OutdoorAirFlow and ASHRAE62_1.SumZone remain deferred.",
    "OutdoorAirFlow Title24.AHU is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for the scalar AHU-level calculation with minOADes=SingleDamper, have_CO2Sen=true, VAbsOutAir_flow=3, and VDesOutAir_flow=8; no-CO2, DedicatedDampersPressure, and non-default AHU parameter variants remain deferred.",
    "OutdoorAirFlow Title24.SumZone is recorded as a restricted source-verified explicit-CXF runtime sequence for a fixed nGro=2, nZon=3, have_CO2Sen=true variant with zonGroMat=[1,1,0;0,1,1]; package-level Title24 support, no-CO2, alternate group/zone sizes, alternate matrices, validation variants, and arbitrary Modelica parsing remain deferred."
